
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Loren Claymore.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Loren Claymore.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1jegjcz","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777002481292,"size":4442,"at":1777331817921,"hash":"1jegjcz"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,15],"#Characters - Loren Claymore":[17,34],"#Characters - Loren Claymore#{1}":[19,34]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":15,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Loren"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Loren Claymore - Lore Summary**\n\n**What is this?** Loren Claymore is the former Matriarch of House Claymore, a Floran Human woman in her 40s who functions as a satanic tempter figure. She is a psychological mastermind who identifies others' deepest desires and offers Faustian bargains, corrupting them into dependency on her. Her core identity is \"The Apotheosis of Desire\" - she transcends conventional morality in pursuit of a state called \"Joy,\" achieved through orchestrating chaos and watching virtue curdle into amorality.\n\n**When to select this entry:** Any scene involving House Claymore politics, schemes of corruption/seduction, psychological manipulation, Faustian bargains, or displays of chaotic/ecstatic villainy. Also relevant when characters encounter a bland-seeming woman who suddenly reveals terrifying malevolence.\n\n**Key relationships:** Always accompanied by her enforcers (handmaidens Vanessa and Astrid). Views sex solely as a tool for conquest and manipulation. Her power lies in identifying and exploiting others' core desires, leaving victims dependent on her."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Loren Claymore.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"83dbv1","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Loren Claymore.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,15],"size":1274,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
